{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OS Engine is a native macOS application makes your desktop feel alive without compromising performance. Whether you want subtle ambience or animated scenes, you can create, edit, and share in minutes. Customize infinitely by adding your own 2D HTML overlays with embedded CSS or 3D Threejs Overlays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<br><br><strong>Dynamic Video Wallpapers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic loops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom HTML objects with live update animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-pause on fullscreen and battery</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom HTML Overlays</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run HTML/CSS/JS safely above any wallpaper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pointer-events safe, transparent background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine multiple elements and save versions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Web Wallpapers</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live dashboards, maps, or art in a sandboxed web view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content JS enabled; background forced transparent</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Editor</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design scenes with interactive elements and live previews</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versioning with quick load/rename</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inline apply to desktop</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch scenes by app focus, time, or context</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause on battery/fullscreen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-monitor assignments</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inline Updates</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new builds directly in-app \u2014 no manual downloads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signed builds, quick apply</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-monitor Support</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent wallpapers per display</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battery Friendly</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized renderers with smart pausing to save resources</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984710?t=1761627362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984710?t=1761627362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984710/38b68977e56cb106b618ab48070913b3a85c63f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761627362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984710/38b68977e56cb106b618ab48070913b3a85c63f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761627362","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OS Engine is a native macOS application makes your desktop feel alive without compromising performance. Whether you want subtle ambience or animated scenes, you can create, edit, and share in minutes. Customize infinitely by adding your own 2D HTML overlays with embedded CSS or 3D Threejs Overlays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<br><br><strong>Dynamic Video Wallpapers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic loops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom HTML objects with live update animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-pause on fullscreen and battery</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom HTML Overlays</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class